    French (fr / fr-CA) string resources for MileageTracker.

    Translation guidelines:
    - Use "l'ARC" (Agence du revenu du Canada) wherever "CRA" appears in EN.
    - Use "kilométrage d'affaires" for "business km".
    - Use "registre de véhicule" for "vehicle logbook".
    - Use "taux kilométrique" for "kilometric rate".
    - Use "aux fins de l'ARC" for "CRA-eligible" / "CRA-ready".
    - Use "déplacement" (trip) or "trajet" contextually.
    - Prefer formal register ("vous" not "tu") throughout.
-->
